   "subject": "simulate d parameters for multidimensional gpcm",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Phil,<div><br></div><div>I&#39;m trying to simulate the d parameters for a multidimensional GPCM model. I see the codes below in the manual to simulate the d parameters for a unidimensional graded model. Do you have any suggestions (e.g., mean, sd, relations between d1, d2, d3 ) to simulate the d parameters of a multidimensional GPCM (for example, 3 score categories (0,1,2))? Thanks a lot!</div><div><br></div><div><pre style=\"box-sizing:inherit;overflow:auto;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,&quot;Andale Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:12.6px;padding-left:1em;padding-right:1em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.87)\"><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(64,128,128);font-style:italic\"># for the graded model, ensure that there is enough space between the intercepts,</span>\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(64,128,128);font-style:italic\"># otherwise closer categories will not be selected often (minimum distance of 0.3 here)</span>\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\">diffs</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(102,102,102)\">&lt;-</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(0,0,255)\"><a href=\"https://rdrr.io/r/base/t.html\" style=\"box-sizing:inherit;background:0px 0px;color:rgb(65,131,196)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://rdrr.io/r/base/t.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792472658161000&amp;usg=AOvVaw38Gi_-Eut-rkBKpAVrSGID\">t</a></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\">(</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(0,0,255)\"><a href=\"https://rdrr.io/r/base/apply.html\" style=\"box-sizing:inherit;background:0px 0px;color:rgb(65,131,196)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://rdrr.io/r/base/apply.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792472658161000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3FNBoG3Rt9pMp1wPgIduGM\">apply</a></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\">(</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(0,0,255)\"><a href=\"https://rdrr.io/r/base/matrix.html\" style=\"box-sizing:inherit;background:0px 0px;color:rgb(65,131,196)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://rdrr.io/r/base/matrix.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792472658161000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1cZgczVMPga9sSYFulJi4Q\">matrix</a></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\">(</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(0,0,255)\"><a href=\"https://rdrr.io/r/stats/Uniform.html\" style=\"box-sizing:inherit;background:0px 0px;color:rgb(65,131,196)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://rdrr.io/r/stats/Uniform.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792472658161000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1ntLnqyNlmyQJCIwfX17qZ\">runif</a></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\">(</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(102,102,102)\">20</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(102,102,102)\">*</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(102,102,102)\">4</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\">,</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(102,102,102)\">.3</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\">,</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(102,102,102)\">1</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\">),</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(102,102,102)\">20</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\">),</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(102,102,102)\">1</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\">,</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\"><a href=\"https://rdrr.io/r/base/cumsum.html\" style=\"box-sizing:inherit;background:0px 0px;color:rgb(65,131,196)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://rdrr.io/r/base/cumsum.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792472658161000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1gd-o50dnYB3JOvRWFwOsw\">cumsum</a></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\">))</span>\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\">diffs</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(102,102,102)\">&lt;-</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(102,102,102)\">-</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\">(</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\">diffs</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(102,102,102)\">-</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(0,0,255)\"><a href=\"https://rdrr.io/r/base/colSums.html\" style=\"box-sizing:inherit;background:0px 0px;color:rgb(65,131,196)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://rdrr.io/r/base/colSums.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792472658161000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2wZ5sCMVVfav51c6BwjVU_\">rowMeans</a></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\">(</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\">diffs</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\">))</span>\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\">d</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(102,102,102)\">&lt;-</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\">diffs</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(102,102,102)\">+</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(0,0,255)\"><a href=\"https://rdrr.io/r/stats/Normal.html\" style=\"box-sizing:inherit;background:0px 0px;color:rgb(65,131,196)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://rdrr.io/r/stats/Normal.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792472658161000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3lZWJ1HcHQzkekUKKWWqMF\">rnorm</a></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\">(</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(102,102,102)\">20</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\">)</span></pre></div></div>"
    ]
